        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At the closing of the Business Combination, we entered into a Management Services Agreement (“MSA”) with Grey Rock Administration, LLC (the \"Manager\"), pursuant to which the Manager supplies land, accounting, engineering, finance, and other back-office services to us in connection with continued management of the Properties contributed to us as part of the Business Combination.",
