        "end_character": 23164
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As such, we seek to capture opportunities at an attractive entry cost by targeting non-marketed packages and developing creative partnerships.",
        "start_character": 6940,
        "end_character": 7082
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Given our acreage footprint and substantial number of well participations, we believe we can make reliably accurate decisions regarding the economics of participating in any proposed development project.",
        "start_character": 5239,
        "end_character": 5442
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Historically, we have achieved higher returns by focusing on projects with near-term development rather than buying assets with a higher proportion of flowing production.",
        "start_character": 7189,
        "end_character": 7359
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, scientific studies on climate change suggest that extreme weather conditions and other risks may occur in the future in the areas where we operate, although the scientific studies are not unanimous.",
        "start_character": 62119,
        "end_character": 62330
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In these partnerships, we account for a significant majority of the capital at risk, so we have significant control over acquisition costs and strategy, development costs, timing and rig schedules, and well design.",
        "start_character": 3871,
        "end_character": 4085
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We aim to encourage, support, and incentivize our team to develop and implement ideas that make us better.",
        "start_character": 9918,
        "end_character": 10024
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We create operated partnerships by investing in assets which are drilled, developed and operated by private operators.",
        "start_character": 3598,
        "end_character": 3716
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We generally rely on our operating partners to market and sell our production.",
        "start_character": 18295,
        "end_character": 18373
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We primarily engage in oil and natural gas development and production by participating on a proportionate basis alongside third-party interests in wells drilled and completed in spacing units that include our acreage.",
        "start_character": 14050,
        "end_character": 14267
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "While we regularly have the right to take a portion of our production in kind, we typically elect to have our operating partners market and sell oil and natural gas produced from wells in which we have an interest.",
        "start_character": 15853,
        "end_character": 16067
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001928446-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001928446-26-000007-2f927c4c26df5ad2",
        "accession_number": "0001928446-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "By building relationships across multiple disciplines and actively seeking creative opportunities to be a value-added partner, we can often access off-market opportunities and mitigate risks inherent in the energy business.",
